#: scenario6:scenario6_409F3110_1A13_408B_BE13_46672FF5AEFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d909c156baa8776f32a5c9363f3a4a936e2e9fa173f6681737ff0ff68ac901b
#. default-sha256: 8abf9c7a54f0e333e77b58aa28cb504779bdb1aa3962f9054cb21279b0209289
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_409F3110_1A13_408B_BE13_46672FF5AEFE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Time pressed "
"onward,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫そして、⟪k:15⟫時を"
"経て……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_E00C943F_4D75_42F5_B79C_13668E56E37E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c61da5f39d0c9ae1c39c3d6b2dc09fa74e3755fb651b40563c5eb23f5fdf5278
#. default-sha256: 3fc28e74bddfb9a7ab4bc78a4a4fd5271f523839a2c63f57bb3aa4356561279b
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_E00C943F_4D75_42F5_B79C_13668E56E37E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and then, at long last, you arrived."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫とうとう、⟪k:1⟫あなたが現れたのです――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_DD418C23_5115_4DCC_BC33_8D2938BF2673
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3198c110fe04d730dc29e9790d9b51b1449592e0a05650c5e6d6b7e23d109022
#. default-sha256: a3e5487dcdc19f4f1e9842b0ae67467fcc2d7a0a268056488b7a88eccdeba256
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DD418C23_5115_4DCC_BC33_8D2938BF2673"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Oh, splendid...⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫You have finally awoken."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫まあ……、⟪k:9⟫やっと、お目覚めになられましたのね。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_D6CCF4FC_DAA4_44F3_A35A_928A6859D487
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e277e9406d92dd3a57c275d54e19cf8c64b6029379ff45431977128ea717c541
#. default-sha256: 39900e8e7e1888ef7532519ee833f0e5a3111e6a868e087c64f5e2f71bb98940
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D6CCF4FC_DAA4_44F3_A35A_928A6859D487"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I have simply been waiting so long for this moment."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたくし、⟪k:1⟫この時を待ちわびていたのですから……。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_EFCBAFD9_6E52_4944_8753_711F7D9B6242
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88b09340b7f6a20c78b05a5f5f53324c314dbc6b3f1ac041256c662cc5f987da
#. default-sha256: e9553d1868755dd2322081b9b9791d6e255b4737a9f325796f6f6f5a4a4e8ad3
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_EFCBAFD9_6E52_4944_8753_711F7D9B6242"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tending to the mansion all by my lonesome,⟪k:1⟫ensuring it was ready for your return, Master—"
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫whenever that time may be."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫このお屋敷をたった一人で手入れをし、⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫いつでも旦那さまがお帰りになれるよう準備をして"
"おりましたの。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_0C8D0830_48A8_4A58_A8AC_3AE5EA6582BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4fa2e94aa5526808ed687df3e16da364fa84c83fb8548d1423053a447ede4be9
#. default-sha256: f774da4a1630a829273d28fa3607bace17778bfccf335e777ff6afd48bb20cb9
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0C8D0830_48A8_4A58_A8AC_3AE5EA6582BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When I caught sight of you through the window,⟪k:1⟫my heart fluttered. ⟪k:2⟫The time had "
"finally arrived."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫窓辺からあなた様のお姿を見つけたとき、⟪k:1⟫わたくし、⟪k:2⟫ついにこの時が来たのだと……。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_67B74B9F_702E_4DDA_9756_FBF35BA48BFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 400d4d57b3c4756d2203371f0173a039aebf7fa66c065315151ad2b2064a99bc
#. default-sha256: 42fb0d75d03b7106f93c66b46a8dabb78a374405cb11b62102b2dc2a35cb726c
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_67B74B9F_702E_4DDA_9756_FBF35BA48BFA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh my, you do not know who I am?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Do you not know who you are, either?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫まあっ、⟪k:2⟫わたくしが誰かですって？⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ではご自分のことも……、⟪k:5⟫ですか？"

#: scenario6:scenario6_2D316048_7959_4D35_9CC6_A42713AAF5F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69d481129470038d5babee4f1884210517e11d3e6c598ea0ef765c7543dd1609
#. default-sha256: ec8c55c40e2fd68577eefe3cd49453b4c8d806a0648401e3848117f3e1988145
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_2D316048_7959_4D35_9CC6_A42713AAF5F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That is quite the predicament."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それは大変……困りましたわ。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_39AFFC0F_BAC7_44C7_9951_ACB95A3C6BFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79bc712abace8366b91aef94b3b10546df97d557916eeb2ad019215ec98ee005
#. default-sha256: e2c78e68188ef992c68d08dd36f97d4eae567ae348107b233d978a36f03324fa
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_39AFFC0F_BAC7_44C7_9951_ACB95A3C6BFA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Then how about this?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫それなら、⟪k:2⟫こういたしましょう。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_F56C1453_143C_4056_A206_C584B42B7282
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55a7167c180bf2610882d18c148aaf942a32db584094b17b1bb523f9bf691ef6
#. default-sha256: 006388f20093109ed23f2a95b1271d3f2345cbe333039b5e008decc7a199dffe
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F56C1453_143C_4056_A206_C584B42B7282"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I am a servant of this mansion, and as such, I am familiar with the many incidents that have "
"taken place here.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I shall show you the history of this house, Master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫わたくしはこのお屋敷の女中、⟪k:1⟫ここで起きた様々な事件を知っております。⟪k:2⟫旦那さまにお屋"
"敷の歴史をお見せいたしましょう。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_82B04417_9973_4CFA_B57C_199EC1D32C00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66f90ad989653599f8b2a515cd585e2832da30d740ae5b26fda6597bf76370d8
#. default-sha256: 8ac69fb6abdda58662d77a836603c1f021111afbed2ae17410fe948317045f5e
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_82B04417_9973_4CFA_B57C_199EC1D32C00"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Let us be off, then.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And fear not—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I merely entreat you not to let go "
"of my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫では参りましょう。⟪k:2⟫大丈夫ですわ、⟪k:3⟫安心なさって。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫どうかわたくしの手を離"
"さないでいてくださいまし。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_4863F686_6A3A_40FA_8698_038389769158
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a66938a28e074bcce10a797f6fe6b0b52a784ae53e0872773411be0aa148ca0
#. default-sha256: f7df2fd3c6b88826c14e7dfa651e3fd5f8e754c74177c16dd4dfc0b05ce76ae8
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_4863F686_6A3A_40FA_8698_038389769158"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Should you hold it tightly, you need not worry about being washed away by the waves of "
"history."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そうすれば、⟪k:1⟫歴史の波に攫われてしまうこともありませんわ。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_24F59810_6B2E_4DD4_AB93_1073D746BA04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3324e80b1a8844c654b0252f539008f3c151fa40d972d29e411207a9ba36327b
#. default-sha256: 67812663188a9a679246992b47f78c752a0fee866ac6d4e9263950412b150194
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_24F59810_6B2E_4DD4_AB93_1073D746BA04"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No matter what happens, you mustn’t let go of my hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そう……どんなことがあっても、⟪k:1⟫わたくしの手を、⟪k:2⟫離さないで……。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_163EC0D0_E2FF_4174_9059_D4A83D451B52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13c9e0104b65387e1ba7d0d344c39b667d3bad103630d5ca59dd6e93d8cceb15
#. default-sha256: 189eddce700e62bda61d15088de5830d4acf6c1db1e4635849c3632da41d0ac5
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_163EC0D0_E2FF_4174_9059_D4A83D451B52"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫No matter what happens..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫どんなことがあっても……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_4DF94911_E146_44DB_9E37_A31671194188
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32346f8eb556f0c8620d176bd2526a2e34da7731752bd768c2ec84270c95fc76
#. default-sha256: e3472deae7705e9f13457720ed9a3da4d935b628ee6e6e2107f64f281498c52e
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_4DF94911_E146_44DB_9E37_A31671194188"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫no matter what you see..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫何が起きても……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_BF129CA0_712B_4687_BB76_D5CAAE6E3137
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4eabc11c56343928d581b6a900198f99733668692ab7881e082c1e6ae02c22c
#. default-sha256: 4e48dbfd6f36f72bd1118b35f23f4d177d30668fc4dca6a593d2a6f74e99a4e2
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_BF129CA0_712B_4687_BB76_D5CAAE6E3137"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫never again..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫もう二度と――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_9CB7481D_46BE_4B1A_ACA9_2845B727CBC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa4823bf9e6959fb40f1bfc624d46ea39fe140e3bf08838786a1f79848ac10cc
#. default-sha256: 3e8e0b6a0836f42d04e812ad30db79055e4a8eb7ae7025ad0832a68fc607e80c
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9CB7481D_46BE_4B1A_ACA9_2845B727CBC5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫let go of this hand..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫この手を離さないで……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_18E2B9AF_AE3C_41CE_A368_93578918249C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9829e3587206cfe64cea434b8f1199c6ef4c35a5d7e5b5fbe7e35fc3b2a21aad
#. default-sha256: 0f7fabeddc96bf420d14e0c819914acd9104650da71e7cc86d932bfa484bd38a
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_18E2B9AF_AE3C_41CE_A368_93578918249C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That... ⟪k:5⟫is everything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……これで……、⟪k:5⟫すべてです。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_99153502_C32A_4E03_9DD6_822B712B48DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eaf3177e3a3321cb0dfd5434cb379698c6d36a8f33798c1d06442b58c94ff26e
#. default-sha256: 9c067a995db57022771ad7a0e244be287104b6d66718df5082c687dab1386de6
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_99153502_C32A_4E03_9DD6_822B712B48DF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫…………。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_1266F294_ED32_406E_94D6_8CCA1AF6B90C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f78d0bbe89f29de7f8d6c98d9357be50a389bb5a7068e21c832d5a5e14d5199
#. default-sha256: 29cbcdfd79dea515707cfccd86aa411884d48c267b58054bdea210c27683bf37
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_1266F294_ED32_406E_94D6_8CCA1AF6B90C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I prepared a number of things to say when she was finished with her tale,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫すべてを語り終えた彼女に、⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫言うべき言葉をいくつも考えていたくせに――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_0CF713FA_806D_4B6A_BAA0_BF374F4C56E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9f2fb60edf3c85ed12cfc401aa36bcc5efa3d8f13242ef55457b94c1bc24cd9
#. default-sha256: b7b2736a032d00322b6c9f901fc07c749071a4d9aaaffd6a47adb8519b405413
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0CF713FA_806D_4B6A_BAA0_BF374F4C56E0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but I can’t manage to put any of them into words."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そのすべてが、⟪k:1⟫出せなかった。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_1F1C88CC_6A6E_4ECC_868A_58408AC2ABA6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8004d3108ba35499993ee1b04caa345bc26444787eb5fa885cbfaffc66cfb977
#. default-sha256: 96ee72799908fedcc3ac48a8aff617e62d1d63888f2a826ef3b9cee33c066a36
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_1F1C88CC_6A6E_4ECC_868A_58408AC2ABA6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I almost hate myself for thinking it would be so easy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女に自分を取り戻させ……、⟪k:1⟫そしてその真実を私が受け止め……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_E53F052F_E604_466B_A462_5229FDF0E856
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2110dc3971cf11a2040ed2aed61fdfc27200a45df360b27d0c1b9f271693e46
#. default-sha256: 066220a21498240d16ee3b8d89d4c024578b1334dc09c045a9b349202d532a73
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_E53F052F_E604_466B_A462_5229FDF0E856"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For letting myself hope I could simply pull her back to her old self,⟪k:1⟫accept whatever "
"had happened to her,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫もう一度彼女の手を取れば――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫それで、⟪k:3⟫すべてが解決し、⟪k:4⟫終わるのではと――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_F3D5627E_7C28_445A_9C3F_932FF496F53E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21e4f8472d461a94a500f598030459ecc10e531420ca7d58ad708f2c135500b1
#. default-sha256: 1ae7271526872b1e619796b028562fd6d986bb4d00eb430cac234863f765fcee
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F3D5627E_7C28_445A_9C3F_932FF496F53E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫take her hand in mine, and that would solve everything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そんな期待を抱いていたことが、⟪k:1⟫許せなくなる……。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_218D7FBB_C459_4977_BB6A_96B43570A67F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d98b792b91a2bb9b87c23130f92f177b9ee9d801eef4bc998c8360e606acdbdf
#. default-sha256: fc94790f73f4c75460921643a73e758f44c532809c5ba004559add89de3ba571
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_218D7FBB_C459_4977_BB6A_96B43570A67F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The truth is so much worse than I imagined—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫so much more harrowing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女の真実は、⟪k:1⟫私が想像していたよりも遥かに残酷で――、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫絶望的だった。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_16D0120E_43DD_41D0_A19C_830C0C139E1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 161d0365418aa3e070d937bff323f6dc7bcd94af71164dd8ee69a3702e9eb687
#. default-sha256: a005bade9c2a695b10836d64b60c6b748ede689ac2b140ac2f30860ebbfd22db
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_16D0120E_43DD_41D0_A19C_830C0C139E1D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was subjected not only to her own terrible fate,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女は、⟪k:1⟫彼女自身の非情な運命のみならず――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_581895C7_70CD_4803_BFC6_FB50FAB30442
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76b5a89aaaf93bbd334698cc58cd55b57f12408da2a882d511b998b216e1220f
#. default-sha256: feb923222e74969ae10a0ed5581d07743ffed139f5fa7da742db9f2ddb39e106
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_581895C7_70CD_4803_BFC6_FB50FAB30442"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but every single one of this house’s tragedies."
